Exposed new environment variable `NAUTOBOT_RATE_LIMITING_REST_BUDGET_WINDOW_IN_SECONDS`
Exposed new environment variable `NAUTOBOT_RATE_LIMITING_REST_BUDGET`
Exposed new environment variable `NAUTOBOT_RATE_LIMITING_REST_MODE`
Exposed new environment variable `NAUTOBOT_RATE_LIMITING_REST_READ_COST`
Exposed new environment variable `NAUTOBOT_RATE_LIMITING_REST_WRITE_COST`
Exposed new environment variable `NAUTOBOT_RATE_LIMITING_REST_INDEXABLE_LOOKUP_COST`
Exposed new environment variable `NAUTOBOT_RATE_LIMITING_REST_UNINDEXABLE_LOOKUP_COST`
Exposed new environment variable `NAUTOBOT_RATE_LIMITING_REST_PAGINATION_COST`
Exposed new environment variable `NAUTOBOT_RATE_LIMITING_REST_DEPTH_MULTIPLIER_PER_LEVEL`
Exposed new environment variable `NAUTOBOT_RATE_LIMITING_REST_COMPUTED_FIELDS_MULTIPLIER`
Exposed new environment variable `NAUTOBOT_RATE_LIMITING_REST_CSV_MULTIPLIER`
Exposed new environment variable `NAUTOBOT_RATE_LIMITING_GRAPHQL_MODE`
Added `nautobot/core/rate_limiting` for rate limiting logic
Added `to_int_or_none` helper function to `nautobot/core/utils/data.py`
Added `RestReadRequestFeatures` to track identifiable query features in a REST read request
Added `classify_rest_read_request_features` to generate a `RestReadRequestFeatures` from a REST request
Added `estimate_rest_read_request_cost` to generate an estimated cost from a `RestReadRequestFeatures` object
Added `calculate_records_per_page` to resolve the page size the paginator will actually serve
Added `number` type support to `nautobot/core/tests/test_settings_schema.py`
Added `ClassifyRestRequestFeaturesTestCase` in `nautobot/core/tests/test_rate_limiting.py` for validation
Documented new settings in `nautobot/core/settings.yaml`
